  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The points X and Y are in a uniform electric field of strength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span>. The distance OX is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> and the distance OY is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"y\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the change in electric potential between X and Y?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Ex\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Ey\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Ex + y\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\\sqrt{x^{2} + y^{2}}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
